+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On the benchmark's 5,000-record store (15,000 cues, 300 hook invocations), the
+`SessionStart` hook cost **17.192 ms p50** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was moved
+off the read path. After that change, it cost **1.048 ms p50**. The latter
+change also introduced the trigger-maintained `meta.fts_rows` counter and made
+the schema's `body` length `CHECK` authoritative, avoiding full-store FTS and
+body-length scans in the read hook.
+
+These are measured end-to-end hook times, including process startup, reported
+by `muninn-bench perf`; they are not estimates.
